Package: tcode
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Thinakaran Manokaran <https://thinakaran.dev/>
Description: lightweight text editor written in Lua
 T Code is a lightweight text editor written mostly in Lua, on top of a
 minimalistic C core using the SDL3 graphics library. It keeps the small,
 fast, extensible design of Lite XL while adding a VS Code-style menu bar,
 integrated terminal, theme picker, word wrap, and native file dialogs.
Homepage: https://thinakaran.dev/
License: MIT
